# A real corpus is a list of someone's possessions, photographed in their home,
# with the room each one is stored in. That is not ours to publish, and it is
# not useful to anyone else either. Only the synthetic pair is committed;
# everything else here -- real.corpus, its box snapshot, any photos -- stays
# local by default rather than by remembering.
*
!.gitignore
!synthetic.corpus
!synthetic.boxes.json
